rent="1" source="tags" target="tt"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1200" y="806"/><mxPoint x="1200" y="694"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="Legend: purple = existing tables | green = new tables | teal dashed = derived views (computed, never stored) | grey dashed = proposed&amp;#xa;Every table also carries user_id = Clerk ID (no FK), id uuid, created_at, updated_at. Ownership lines are drawn for the main tables only.&amp;#xa;&amp;#xa;Rules for the migrations&amp;#xa;1. Money = integer centavos + currency code. Never floats.&amp;#xa;2. Actual and expected are separate tables. Left over uses actual_transactions only. Actual vs expected joins the two by month and category.&amp;#xa;3. expected_transaction_id on an actual row is optional. It records which plan an actual entry fulfilled. One expected row may be fulfilled by many actual rows. The link must have the same type and main category.&amp;#xa;4. Composite FKs on (user_id, id) for every link so rows cannot cross users. sub_categories has UK (user_id, main_category_id, id); both transaction tables link to it with (user_id, main_category_id, sub_category_id).&amp;#xa;5. Type must match the main category type: main_categories has UK (user_id, id, type); both transaction tables link with (user_id, main_category_id, type).&amp;#xa;6. Actual expenses require payment_method_id (check constraint). Expected rows have no payment method, account, or tags.&amp;#xa;7. Main or sub categories with transactions cannot be deleted (restrict). Tags are per user, unique by name, and attach to actual rows only.&amp;#xa;8. RLS on every table: authenticated only, user_id = (select auth.jwt()-&gt;&gt;'sub'), with check on insert and update. Views run with caller permissions.&amp;#xa;9. Indexes: actual_transactions (user_id, transaction_date), expected_transactions (user_id, expected_date)." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F1A2B;fillColor=#F5F3F8;strokeColor=#E5E1EC;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="940" width="1100" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>